  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List - <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> with List - <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math><br />\t\t\t(Colloid Preparation Method)</strong></td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math><br />\t\t\t(Chemical Reaction)</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Hydrolysis</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>AuCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>HCHO</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mn>2</mn><mi>Au</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>sol</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>HCOOH</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>HCl</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Reduction</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>As</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>As</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>sol</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Oxidation</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>iii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>sol</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Double Decomposition</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>iv</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Fe</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>sol</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>HCl</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :</p>",
